        "REVIEW|||Dining Pro 🏆|||You unlocked 4 restaurant ordering skills:\n\n1. **Customizing ingredients** with *'Hold the...'* & *'On the side'*\n2. **Connected Speech**: **'hold-thuh-may-o'** flow\n3. **Requesting substitutions**\n4. **US dining customization** norms|||Elo: Pedido feito igual a um verdadeiro nativo!"
