        "VOCAB|||City Navigation Terms 🚇|||*   **'Intersection'** - Where two streets cross (*at the intersection*).\n*   **'Transfer'** - Change train or bus lines (*transfer to the Red Line*).\n*   **'Out and about'** - Out in the city doing activities.\n*   **'Landmark'** - Easily recognizable building or monument.|||Elo: 'Out and about' é a expressão perfeita para passear pela cidade.",
