        "REVIEW|||City Navigator 🏆|||You unlocked 4 urban navigation skills:\n\n1. **Transit phrasing** (*Transfer lines, Intersections*)\n2. **Connected Speech**: **'ow-din-uh-bout'** link\n3. **Asking for directions** using city landmarks\n4. **US city block navigation** culture|||Elo: Cidade dominada! Você se desloca com total autonomia."
