        "CONCEPT|||Connected Speech: Try-yi-ton 🗣️|||Phonetic linking when trying on clothing items.\n\n> 🗣️ **Connected Speech Phonetics:**\n> * *'Try it on'* becomes **'try-yi-ton'**\n> * *'Out of stock'* becomes **'ow-duh-stock'**|||Elo: Diga 'can-ai-try-yi-ton' com naturalidade.",
