        "REVIEW|||Retail Master 🏆|||You unlocked 4 shopping & return skills:\n\n1. **Trying on clothes** with *'Try it on'*\n2. **Connected Speech**: **'try-yi-ton'** link\n3. **Processing returns** with *'Receipt'* & *'Full refund'*\n4. **US retail customer service** norms|||Elo: Compras e trocas dominadas com total segurança!"
