        "CONCEPT|||Connected Speech: O-ver-thuh-coun-ter 🗣️|||Flow through compound pharmacy terminology.\n\n> 🗣️ **Connected Speech Phonetics:**\n> * *'Over the counter'* becomes **'o-ver-thuh-coun-ter'**\n> * *'Painkiller'* becomes **'pain-kil-ler'**|||Elo: Treine falar 'o-ver-thuh-coun-ter' com fluidez.",
