        "ROLEPLAY|||🎭 Seattle Pike Place Market|||Drinking coffee with your friend Sarah in Seattle. Tell her you feel slightly sick.\n\n> *\"Hey! You look a little tired today. Is everything okay?\"*\n\n> 🎭 **Challenge:** Tell Sarah you feel *'un-der-thuh-we-ther'* and ask for a *'rain-check'* on the boat tour.|||Elo: Converse com a Sarah e remarque o passeio!",
        "REVIEW|||Idiom Expert 🏆|||You unlocked 4 daily idiom skills:\n\n1. **Expressing mild illness** with *'Under the weather'*\n2. **Connected Speech**: **'un-der-thuh-we-ther'** link\n3. **Polite rescheduling** with *'Rain check'*\n4. **US weather metaphor** cultural fluency|||Elo: Expressões do dia a dia dominadas com maestria!"
