        "VOCAB|||Sports Metaphors 🏈|||*   **'Drop the ball'** - Make a mistake or fail a task (*I dropped the ball*).\n*   **'Touch base'** - Check in or connect briefly (*Let me touch base with you*).\n*   **'Hit a home run'** - Achieve a huge success.\n*   **'Ballpark figure'** - Rough estimate (*Give me a ballpark figure*).|||Elo: 'Touch base' é a expressão mais usada em e-mails nos EUA.",
