        "EXAMPLE|||Workplace Update 📊|||*\"I sorry I **drop-thuh-ball** on that email, let's **touch-bays** tomorrow morning.\"*\n\n> 🗣️ **Phonetics:**\n> *'Tomorrow morning'* links into **'tuh-mor-ro-mor-nin'**.|||Elo: Admitiu o erro e agendou um acompanhamento.",
        "CULTURE|||American Sports in Business 🇺🇸|||Baseball and American football supply over 50% of US corporate metaphors ('ballpark figure', 'tackle the problem', 'game plan').|||Elo: Entender metáforas esportivas destrava o inglês dos negócios.",
        "DRILL|||⚡ Quick Challenge: Requesting an Estimate|||Your manager needs a quick rough price estimate for a project:\n\n*\"How much do you think this new marketing campaign will cost?\"*\n\n> 🗣️ **Help Box (Your Response):**\n> * *'Can I give you a ballpark figure by 2 PM?'*\n> \n> 🏆 **XP Multiplier:** Use 'ballpark figure' smoothly!|||Elo: Ofereça a estimativa aproximada!|||Can I give you a ballpark figure by 2 PM?",
        "ROLEPLAY|||🎭 Chicago Office Standup|||Syncing up with coworker Mike in downtown Chicago after a major product launch.\n\n> *\"Hey! The launch campaign went surprisingly well!\"*\n\n> 🎭 **Challenge:** Tell Mike the team *'hit a home run'* and suggest to *'touch-bays'* next Monday.|||Elo: Comemore o sucesso com o Mike!",
        "REVIEW|||Sports Metaphor Champion 🏆|||You unlocked 4 sports idiom skills:\n\n1. **Admitting mistakes** with *'Drop the ball'*\n2. **Connected Speech**: **'touch-bays'** link\n3. **Estimating metrics** with *'Ballpark figure'*\n4. **US corporate sports metaphor** culture|||Elo: Jogada de mestre! Metáforas esportivas dominadas."
