        "CULTURE|||US Workplace Efficiency Culture 🇺🇸|||Corporate jargon like 'on the same page' keeps alignment discussions short and actionable. Efficient alignment saves meeting time.|||Elo: Confirmar que todos estão 'on the same page' evita erros de projeto.",
        "DRILL|||⚡ Quick Challenge: Team Alignment|||Check if your team agrees on the project strategy before launching:\n\n*\"Before we wrap up, does everyone understand the new direction?\"*\n\n> 🗣️ **Help Box (Your Response):**\n> * *'Yes, we are all on the same page!'*\n> \n> 🏆 **XP Multiplier:** Say 'on the same page' with total confidence!|||Elo: Confirme o alinhamento da equipe!|||Yes, we are all on the same page!",
